# ReXGlue SDK patch: macOS/MoltenVK fixes for the NHL Legacy predicated-tiling
# 3D scene, plus an InputSystem data race that also affects Windows.
# Base revision: rexglue-sdk main @ c94f5eb (v0.10.0).
# Apply with:  git -C third_party/rexglue-sdk-main apply ../../sdk/rexglue-macos-fsi-tiling-fixes.patch
#
# Contents:
#  - InputSystem: add a recursive mutex around device access. Without it any
#    connected controller crashes (proven with ASan: free on a non-malloc'd
#    address, freed by RefreshDevices). NOT macOS-specific.
#  - gpu-xenos: default symbol visibility so consumers can subclass
#    VulkanCommandProcessor off-Windows (145 symbols present, 0 exported).
#  - REXGLUE_ROOT as a CACHE INTERNAL var so add_subdirectory consumers resolve
#    the MoltenVK ICD path.
#  - FSI 2x MSAA: write both guest samples from a single invocation. MoltenVK
#    never delivers coverage for the second sample, so guest sample 1 was never
#    written and the resolve averaged every pixel with stale EDRAM.
#  - Signed viewport origin: the second tiling pass needs viewport x=-640 w=1280
#    (a translation). Clamping to 0 gave w=640 ndc_scale=2, squashing the whole
#    1280-wide scene into the 640-wide surface.
#  - Suppress the FIRST tiling pass's colour clear only. MoltenVK will not order
#    that compute clear before the next pass's fragment writes by any available
#    means, so it lands on top of pass B's geometry.
#  - g_skip_ps_active: make the REX_SKIP_PS draw filter a live atomic instead of
#    a value latched from the environment at startup, so the port can gate NHL's
#    edge-AA/bloom pass per frame (wanted over the 2D menus, blows silhouettes
#    out to white over the 3D scene).
#  - REX_GFX_REINIT_AT_SWAP: probe that tears down and rebuilds the graphics
#    context mid-run, to measure whether a supersampling change could be applied
#    live. See the comment on MaybeReinitContextForProbe for the result.
#  - Diagnostics behind env vars (REX_VP_LOG, REX_VP_INPUT_LOG,
#    REX_CLEAR_DEBUG_COLOR, REX_RESOLVE_SAMPLE, ...) - all no-ops when unset.

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
index 9b3cdf5..abfeb3d 100644
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -53,7 +53,12 @@ if (REXGLUE_ENABLE_FIDELITYFX AND
 endif()
 
 # Root of the SDK source tree
-set(REXGLUE_ROOT "${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}")
+# CACHE INTERNAL so it survives into the parent scope: consumers that pull the
+# SDK in with add_subdirectory() (the REXSDK_DIR path) call
+# _rexglue_stage_macos_vulkan_runtime() from their own directory scope, where a
+# plain set() is not visible — the macOS ICD staging then resolves to
+# "/cmake/MoltenVK_icd.json" and the POST_BUILD copy fails.
+set(REXGLUE_ROOT "${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}" CACHE INTERNAL "ReXGlue SDK source root")
 
 # SDK install support
 include(GNUInstallDirs)
