+    // frame's first pass, so it cannot race, and it gives pass A a properly
+    // cleared surface. Suppressing both (REX_NO_TILE8_CLEAR) instead leaves
+    // BOTH passes compositing over stale colour, which washes the whole frame.
+    // Opt out with REX_KEEP_FIRST_TILE_CLEAR=1.
+    // OFF by default now. This was a workaround for the second tiling pass
