+    // cleared (see IsClearingDepth); with that fixed the second pass covers
+    // 100% of its surface (measured 0.00% uncovered via REX_CLEAR_DEBUG_COLOR),
+    // so the clear can no longer bleed and suppressing it only cost correct
+    // blending. Re-enable with REX_NO_FIRST_TILE_CLEAR=1.
+    static const bool no_first_tile_clear =
